link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24351-garygeneric","name":"Garygeneric","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T17:37:39-07:00","id":1400428,"title":"","content":"Fuck yeah. ^__^<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400364#post1400364\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder what Justin Achilli thinks of what they've done to the Giovanni since they were his baby.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup, they were amazing.<br /> <br /> *<i>Jumps on the nostalgy train without a second thought</i>*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/250518/Dark-Shores-Lineages--of-the-Great-Lakes\" target=\"_blank\">VTM: Dark Shores: Lineages of the Great Lakes</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/264262/Fingers-of-the-Eldest-Bogatyri\" target=\"_blank\">VTM: Fingers of the Eldest: Bogatyri</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/295115/Forgotten-Alliances\" target=\"_blank\">WTA: Forgotten Alliances</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24483-salamander","name":"SalamanDer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24483_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T17:53:43-07:00","id":1400434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Garygeneric</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400365#post1400365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019d prefer f they kept Tzimisce out of the Camarilla and had a faction instead fall in with the Anarch. Not only does it allow for greater range in the clan\u2019s playability, but I like the possible dichotomy of Lasombra and Tzimisce being heart and soul of the Sabbat while being the bitterest of enemies among those outside the faction.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm pretty certain the Tzimisce will continue to be primarilly Sabbat-aligned. But V5 isn't arbitrarily keeping any individuals out of any sect because of their clan. So there are <i>some </i>Camarilla-aligned Tzimisce, as there will be some Tzimisce Anarchs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T18:03:58-07:00","id":1400436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400360#post1400360\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think they'll get the vtr treatment,<br /> <br /> humanity will be the standard, and sabbat will be degenerates<br /> <br /> with the lasombra and tzimisce in the camarilla, the sabbat will just be a ramassis of antitribu bloodlines,<br /> the clan dynamics will probably be gone<br /> <br /> edit: Achilli was the one who did vtr right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Achilli did the Requiem, but only after being the lead developer throughout the Revised edition of Masquerade, which, if anything, made the Sabbat more prominent than they'd ever been, even putting them in the core book.<br /> <br /> However, he never cared for paths of enlightenment, nor have any of the developers since 2e. The general consensus is that the Sabbat's function as the low-Humanity sect is undermined by giving them all these paths that give them an out. So anyone hoping for a return to the 2e treatment of the Sabbat... yeah, don't hold your breath. It was never going to happen. A more realistic hope is that the Sabbat will have some means of using their cult brainwashing/rituals to slow their degeneration, in a manner not unlike the blood cults we see in <i>Cults of the Blood Gods</i>. They are, after all, basically just the biggest of the blood cults.<br /> <br /> As for <i>antitribu</i>, it's not really a thing in V5. Any individual can be in any sect, but the game doesn't treat them as a distinct bloodline, since sect loyalty and heredity are independent of each other. However, it is true that each clan's <i>leadership </i>associated with a particular sect, which suggests that's where most of them will end up because they'll have better representation there. But there are members of each clan in each sect because it would be weird if there weren't. They're not monoliths or hive minds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T18:23:34-07:00","id":1400437,"title":"","content":"I like what I know of Justin Achilli\u2019s vision of the Sabbat (which admittedly isn\u2019t much). I agree with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar352_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"352\" data-vbnamecard=\"352\">Black Flag</a> that the Paths of Enlightenment basically allow the Sabbat to avoid confronting just how horrific their existence really is (especially the Path of Harmony, which I\u2019m pretty sure they got rid of in later editions). At the same time, I don\u2019t want the Sabbat to be totally feral either. I hope in V5 they\u2019re able to strike a balance between the two approaches.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T18:29:32-07:00","id":1400440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400437#post1400437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like what I know of Justin Achilli\u2019s vision of the Sabbat (which admittedly isn\u2019t much). I agree with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar352_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"352\" data-vbnamecard=\"352\">Black Flag</a> that the Paths of Enlightenment basically allow the Sabbat to avoid confronting just how horrific their existence really is (especially the Path of Harmony, which I\u2019m pretty sure they got rid of in later editions). At the same time, I don\u2019t want the Sabbat to be totally feral either. I hope in V5 they\u2019re able to strike a balance between the two approaches.</div> </div> </div> </div>Circa 1999, I used to play a Path of Harmony follower in the Sabbat when I opened a book and it said, &quot;The Sabbat slaughtered all the Path of Harmony followers.&quot;<br /> <br /> Justin Achilli also helped develop the Paths as an alternative to Humanity that came with serious downsides to balance the &quot;Path of What I want to do anyway.&quot; It was pretty much the opposite take to handling it that that Dark Ages took.<br /> <br /> Justin emphasized how alien, difficult, and terrifying the Paths of Enlightenment were. That you basically had to unlearn how human beings thought and then force your brain to think according to new principles as well as instincts. Even then you would be denied Golconda, have a Humanity 4 max equivalent for all the special benefits of High Humanity no matter your score, and following the heirarchy was as hard as Humanity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-01-2020, 09:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T18:33:05-07:00","id":1400442,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12002_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12002\" data-vbnamecard=\"12002\">CTPhipps</a> wow!! Thanks. So that\u2019s what happened to them all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T18:35:55-07:00","id":1400444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400442#post1400442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12002_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12002\" data-vbnamecard=\"12002\">CTPhipps</a> wow!! Thanks. So that\u2019s what happened to them all.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was, hilariously, a fan of Paths from 2nd Edition like Taggie until that point. My opinion being, &quot;The Sabbat is open minded enough that they have their own Children of Gaia equivalent who want to encourage Sabbat not to be evil assholes and maybe just reach an accomadation with the Beast rather than engage in outright evil.&quot;<br /> <br /> After that, I was like, &quot;Yeah, the Sabbat are doomed. Now all my Sabbat games are about figuring out what to do with a sinking ship.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T19:04:32-07:00","id":1400445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Garygeneric</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400362#post1400362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does this mean Achilli might have a chance to give the (near-mythical) Player\u2019s Guide a treatment before it hits redlines? Or would that fall outside his bailiwick in his new position?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> White Wolf doesn't do any writing in house and that doesn't look to change at all, but as lead creative he's likely going to have input on any particular details of how what's in the book fits into Paradox's desired timeline and design for the game as a whole. So it'll be much like it has been, most likely, where they give it a cover to ensure it fits their plots/vision for the line but won't do any actual writing themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T22:08:41-07:00","id":1400456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Flag</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400436#post1400436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Achilli did the Requiem, but only after being the lead developer throughout the Revised edition of Masquerade, which, if anything, made the Sabbat more prominent than they'd ever been, even putting them in the core book.<br /> <br /> However, he never cared for paths of enlightenment, nor have any of the developers since 2e. The general consensus is that the Sabbat's function as the low-Humanity sect is undermined by giving them all these paths that give them an out. So anyone hoping for a return to the 2e treatment of the Sabbat... yeah, don't hold your breath. It was never going to happen. A more realistic hope is that the Sabbat will have some means of using their cult brainwashing/rituals to slow their degeneration, in a manner not unlike the blood cults we see in <i>Cults of the Blood Gods</i>. They are, after all, basically just the biggest of the blood cults.<br /> <br /> As for <i>antitribu</i>, it's not really a thing in V5. Any individual can be in any sect, but the game doesn't treat them as a distinct bloodline, since sect loyalty and heredity are independent of each other. However, it is true that each clan's <i>leadership </i>associated with a particular sect, which suggests that's where most of them will end up because they'll have better representation there. But there are members of each clan in each sect because it would be weird if there weren't. They're not monoliths or hive minds.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then they are of no interest to me. Mindless degeneration is dull, which is why the VtR designated bad guys are so flat and uninteresting, Paths and the philosophy behind them, if done well, is by far the most interesting concept in WoD. So far as previewed the Cults are a hollow mockery of that. humanity should be hard, it needs killing under any circumstances to be a degeneration check, with anyone who kills being right on the edge of wassail, or it is meaningless, Paths need to be the way out of that, just as hard, but for different reasons, for 'Beast I be least Beast I become' to mean anything","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 07-02-2020, 01:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T01:12:23-07:00","id":1400470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400444#post1400444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was, hilariously, a fan of Paths from 2nd Edition like Taggie until that point. My opinion being, &amp;quot;The Sabbat is open minded enough that they have their own Children of Gaia equivalent who want to encourage Sabbat not to be evil assholes and maybe just reach an accomadation with the Beast rather than engage in outright evil.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> After that, I was like, &amp;quot;Yeah, the Sabbat are doomed. Now all my Sabbat games are about figuring out what to do with a sinking ship.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>So do you prefer the Path of Harmony to the Path of the Feral Heart that replaced it in Revised?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T02:19:08-07:00","id":1400478,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Flag</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400436#post1400436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Achilli did the Requiem, but only after being the lead developer throughout the Revised edition of Masquerade, which, if anything, made the Sabbat more prominent than they'd ever been, even putting them in the core book.<br /> <br /> However, he never cared for paths of enlightenment, nor have any of the developers since 2e. The general consensus is that the Sabbat's function as the low-Humanity sect is undermined by giving them all these paths that give them an out. So anyone hoping for a return to the 2e treatment of the Sabbat... yeah, don't hold your breath. It was never going to happen. A more realistic hope is that the Sabbat will have some means of using their cult brainwashing/rituals to slow their degeneration, in a manner not unlike the blood cults we see in <i>Cults of the Blood Gods</i>. They are, after all, basically just the biggest of the blood cults.<br /> <br /> As for <i>antitribu</i>, it's not really a thing in V5. Any individual can be in any sect, but the game doesn't treat them as a distinct bloodline, since sect loyalty and heredity are independent of each other. However, it is true that each clan's <i>leadership </i>associated with a particular sect, which suggests that's where most of them will end up because they'll have better representation there. But there are members of each clan in each sect because it would be weird if there weren't. They're not monoliths or hive minds.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not expecting a return to 2e or even revised sabbat,<br /> <br /> I'm saying the sabbat will probably get the vtr treatment, something akin to Belial's brood,<br /> and it matches<br /> <br /> Belial's Brood were the &quot;low humanity&quot; vampires<br /> <br /> the &quot;all sabbat are antitribu&quot; is just me saying that they'll hack the clan dynamics in the sect or simplify them enough that it won't be of much relevance,<br /> not just the clans but also the paths of enlightenment, churches and cults,<br /> <br /> I mean, considering the sabbat is losing the clergy and the majority of their territories,<br /> there's not much space for them to establish clan dynamics or paths<br /> <br /> so...Belial's Brood","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":10998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","user":"Pleiades","date":". 07-02-2020, 05:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T02:32:46-07:00","id":1400481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Flag</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The general consensus is that the Sabbat's function as the low-Humanity sect is undermined by giving them all these paths that give them an out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Who in the world made this the general consensus? Since when has any fan of the Sabbat or just Sabbat mains in general thought this would a good idea? I don't think even people who aren't fans of the Sabbat want this lol<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">hack the clan dynamics in the sect or simplify them enough that it won't be of much relevance,<br /> not just the clans but also the paths of enlightenment, churches and cults</div> </div> </div> </div>At that point you may as just retnuke the Sabbat from VTM then. That just sounds downright horrible for the Sabbat or any interesting complexities that had before V5. Also bringing in MORE &quot;inspiration&quot; from VTR? Yeah that doesn't sound like a good idea at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":25523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","user":"Shakanaka","date":". 07-02-2020, 05:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T03:03:42-07:00","id":1400486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400481#post1400481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Who in the world made this the general consensus? Since when has any fan of the Sabbat or just Sabbat mains in general thought this would a good idea? I don't think even people who aren't fans of the Sabbat want this lol</div> </div> </div> </div>you're not wrong, but let's not make generalizations about sabbat fans,<br /> sabbat fans are wildly varried, and they don't agree on alot of things<br /> <br /> some want the sabbat to have clans, others want them to be caitiff,<br /> some want them to be immoral vampires that sin and practice dark arts unchecked, while others want them to have their own ethics and moral conflicts,<br /> some of them want to have intrigue and politickz, others want them to solve issues solely through the power of their fists (or magic)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> At that point you may as just retnuke the Sabbat from VTM then. That just sounds downright horrible for the Sabbat or any interesting complexities that had before V5. Also bringing in MORE &quot;inspiration&quot; from VTR? Yeah that doesn't sound like a good idea at all. </div> </div> </div>yeah, but at this point, Belial's Brood sabbat sounds like the only option left, along with MET sabbat,<br /> the description of the sabbat matches BB so well (monsters that want to destroy everything you care about) that I can't imagine anything else,<br /> <br /> and, the devs clearly don't want the old sabbat back,<br /> if so, I'd rather have Belial's Brood Sabbat than MET Sabbat (if you don't know what MET sabbat is, don't look it up, you might explode...trust me, not good for your health),<br /> <br /> considering that one of the main WW contributers is the MET guy...I'm willing to let Achilli use his vtr wand all he wants :/","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":10998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","user":"Pleiades","date":". 07-02-2020, 06:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T03:05:50-07:00","id":1400487,"title":"","content":"What's MET Sabbat? lol","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T03:17:00-07:00","id":1400488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400456#post1400456\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Then they are of no interest to me. Mindless degeneration is dull, which is why the VtR designated bad guys are so flat and uninteresting, Paths and the philosophy behind them, if done well, is by far the most interesting concept in WoD. <b>So far as previewed the Cults are a hollow mockery of that. </b>humanity should be hard, it needs killing under any circumstances to be a degeneration check, with anyone who kills being right on the edge of wassail, or it is meaningless, Paths need to be the way out of that, just as hard, but for different reasons, for 'Beast I be least Beast I become' to mean anything</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Perhaps its not the best forum to be running down an Onyx Path product.</span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400470#post1400470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So do you prefer the Path of Harmony to the Path of the Feral Heart that replaced it in Revised?</div> </div> </div> </div>Absolutely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T03:17:23-07:00","id":1400489,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400487#post1400487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's MET Sabbat? lol</div> </div> </div> </div>it's the LARP version,<br /> I don't know how to describe it without sounding like an angry edgelord...but I'll try<br /> <br /> they have some similarities to the V5 ones, in that they got demolished by hunters and lost territory to the cam/anarchs (Canada and east coast being the biggest losses)<br /> Lasombra/tzimisce lost the hegemony,<br /> and the sect war against the camarilla was shifted to attacking the independants (assamite, setites and giovanni),<br /> <br /> the status quo faction got overthrown by the orthodoxy with a Gangrel Regent,<br /> Toreador antis and Assamite antis got reduced to 3rd rate citizens to the same degree as panders,<br /> masquerade is enforced now in the sect<br /> <br /> edit: I mean no offense to the MET devs, they have some of the best storytellers,<br /> I'm just not very found of the lore/setting","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":10998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","user":"Pleiades","date":". 07-02-2020, 06:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T03:20:35-07:00","id":1400490,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">FYI - Given Achilli has said nothing about the Sabbat, what he would do with the Sabbat, or made any plans - speculating about what they'll be like under him is fine but acting as if ANYTHING has been said, let alone they'd be Belial's brood or Path-centric or whatnot is wrong.<br /> <br /> He may decide the next few volumes should be donated to capturing the spirit of True Blood or Young Adult vampire fiction.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> I've created an official &quot;Sabbat in V5&quot; thread for everyone to discuss the subject: </span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-sabbat-in-v5\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-sabbat-in-v5</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=S