g about what they'll be like under him is fine but acting as if ANYTHING has been said, let alone they'd be Belial's brood or Path-centric or whatnot is wrong.<br /> <br /> He may decide the next few volumes should be donated to capturing the spirit of True Blood or Young Adult vampire fiction.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> I've created an official &amp;quot;Sabbat in V5&amp;quot; thread for everyone to discuss the subject: </span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400491-v5-the-sabbat-in-v5\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-sabbat-in-v5</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Completely agree with the last paragraph right above the Edit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T06:36:44-07:00","id":1400511,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400440#post1400440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Circa 1999, I used to play a Path of Harmony follower in the Sabbat when I opened a book and it said, &quot;The Sabbat slaughtered all the Path of Harmony followers.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Kinda reminds me of how some of the Shadowrun 4e books detailed the SR equivalent of 3D printing (which, if I recall correctly, were called &quot;nanoforges&quot;). My character, as a hacker, got big into printing gear on the cheap and with no paper trail to lead back to us. We even stole the specs for some cyberware that could be safely nanoforged and had it implanted into one of the other PCs.<br /> <br /> \u200bThen 5e details how one day <i>all</i> the nanoforges worldwide mysteriously stopped working and <i>anything created by one</i> just up and melted into slag in some freak magic incident. I don't recall if the cyberware was one of those that replaces your heart or nervous system or anything else critical like that, but either way, having that happen inside your body <i>can't</i> be good for you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 07-02-2020, 09:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T09:28:02-07:00","id":1400530,"title":"","content":"Wow they actually found someone worse to replace Martin with, not that big of a surprise in their choice though. Based on my past interactions with Mr. Achilli there isn't any person in the world I wouldn't replace him with if I wanted to produce complete quality products. I can't wait to see how many incomplete things get published from now on with him in charge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25664-gubenyochi","name":"Gubenyochi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","titl