{"date":"2020-07-02T11:46:27-07:00","id":1400552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400532#post1400532\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25664-gubenyochi\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25664\" data-vbnamecard=\"25664\">Gubenyochi</a> what didn't you like about his works?</div> </div> </div> </div>1.) His writing style (for example vampire have to be &quot;EVIL&quot; vs Grey) is the antithesis of everything good about Vampire the Masquerade.<br /> <br /> 2.) He releases incomplete products that skip sections half way through, see 1st ed Dark Ages ST guide it literally goes from a rule description to mid sentence of fluff.<br /> <br /> 3) His general sense of arrogance with regards to issues like that of number 2. I asked about the missing content and if there would be an errata containing it and he told me very nicely to piss off. This is the kind of interactions I've seen him have with people who don't worship him.<br /> <br /> 4) He has a &quot;one true way&quot; to play vampire and hates fans who are having fun wrong. You can find this in numerous interview with him.<br /> <br /> Is that better, now that it includes examples? <br /> <br /> I'm sure his &quot;one true way&quot; vision aligns more with V5 than with Revised or V20, which is why I'm not surprised. For me, it just removes all hope that V5 will ever evolve to incorporate styles of play that are &quot;wrong&quot; in his eyes aka something I'd actually want to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25664-gubenyochi","name":"Gubenyochi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T11:51:15-07:00","id":1400554,"title":"","content":"I guess it would be a good idea to wait for any Mr. Achilli's actual actions in his new post...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;No, no, don't look any further, my profile is actually more handsome than me&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3586-alqamar-alaswad","name":"Alqamar Alaswad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T11:51:32-07:00","id":1400555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gubenyochi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400552#post1400552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\