s-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-07T12:48:09-07:00","id":1401539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1401509#post1401509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Disciplines will not be going above five dots. There's no need for it. It's just as easy to make amalgams.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for answering. My question is not about this specific subject, but about matters in general, which were informed to us in the interviews, podcasts, articles and your comments. I'm not asking you to answer because I know that these things are delicate and complicated. I was more willing to hear hunches. Anyway, thanks again for responding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-07T14:56:12-07:00","id":1401561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1401509#post1401509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Disciplines will not be going above five dots. There's no need for it. It's just as easy to make amalgams.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not with the '1 power per dot' limit, and the lack of power amalgams have versus the old 7-9 disciplines, the irony is, we get a book about Blood God's when the system doesn't support that level of power anymore. We no longer have the blot out the sun, turn an entire city into devoted servants etc etc of the Eldest Methuselahs. It's a totally different flavour of setting. Old ST of mine described Methuselah Vs Antediluvian Vs Caine as ground zero of a tactical nuke, ground zero of a the thermonuke, ground zero of the KT asteroid strike, when compared to characters, either way, pcs die when deities walk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 07-07-2020, 05:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-07T17:21:57-07:00","id":1401578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1401561#post1401561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not with the '1 power per dot' limit, and the lack of power amalgams have versus the old 7-9 disciplines, the irony is, we get a book about Blood God's when the system doesn't support that level of power anymore. We no longer have the blot out the sun, turn an entire city into devoted servants etc etc of the Eldest Methuselahs. It's a totally different flavour of setting. Old ST of mine described Methuselah Vs Antediluvian Vs Caine as ground zero of a tactical nuke, ground zero of a the thermonuke, ground zero of the KT asteroid strike, when compared to characters, either way, pcs die when deities walk.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well you actually got a book about Cults of the Blood Gods, hence why there were no 5 / 5 amalgams in there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-07T22:43:13-07:00","id":1401623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1401578#post1401578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well you actually got a book about Cults of the Blood Gods, hence why there were no 5 / 5 amalgams in there.</div> </div> </div> </div>But to have that 5/5 amalgam, you loose the lvl 5 in 1 of the disciplines involved, and can never, ever under any circumstances learn it. That limit is crippling, at any level, but especially for elders and meths, Also are we talking abilities on the scale of Perfect World, or Draught of Phoenix Blood...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 07-08-2020, 01:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T08:56:35-07:00","id":1401700,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1401561#post1401561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not with the '1 power per dot' limit, and the lack of power amalgams have versus the old 7-9 disciplines, the irony is, we get a book about Blood God's when the system doesn't support that level of power anymore. We no longer have the blot out the sun, turn an entire city into devoted servants etc etc of the Eldest Methuselahs. It's a totally different flavour of setting. Old ST of mine described Methuselah Vs Antediluvian Vs Caine as ground zero of a tactical nuke, ground zero of a the thermonuke, ground zero of the KT asteroid strike, when compared to characters, either way, pcs die when deities walk.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see that as one of the biggest improvements in the new edition. Vampires as peers of the Great Cthulhu aren't my thing. To me, personally, the point of elders is to have loads of Highlander/Forever Knight style flashbacks, not godlike power. The new edition does a great job of that, even introducing a system - Memoriam - specifically dedicated to it.<br /> <br /> The 1-power-per-dot thing strikes me as overly restrictive for elder characters, especially as there's no limit on the number of amalgam powers you can buy. In some cases it denies you abilities that you had before - you can no longer have earth meld, wolf form, bat form <i>and </i>mist form, for instance, one of them has to go. But you do have greater versatility in Discipline development to compensate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/100-jezmiller","name":"JezMiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"437"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T10:39:01-07:00","id":1401711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JezMiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1401700#post1401700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I see that as one of the biggest improvements in the new edition. Vampires as peers of the Great Cthulhu aren't my thing. To me, personally, the point of elders is to have loads of Highlander/Forever Knight style flashbacks, not godlike power. The new edition does a great job of that, even introducing a system - Memoriam - specifically dedicated to it.<br /> <br /> The 1-power-per-dot thing strikes me as overly restrictive for elder characters, especially as there's no limit on the number of amalgam powers you can buy. In some cases it denies you abilities that you had before - you can no longer have earth meld, wolf form, bat form <i>and </i>mist form, for instance, one of them has to go. But you do have greater versatility in Discipline development to compensate.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I loved the meths as actual blood gods mechanics, that credible global threat is now gone, they aren't a threat to civilisations any more","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T10:40:16-07:00","id":1401712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JezMiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1401700#post1401700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I see that as one of the biggest improvements in the new edition. Vampires as peers of the Great Cthulhu aren't my thing. To me, personally, the point of elders is to have loads of Highlander/Forever Knight style flashbacks, not godlike power. The new edition does a great job of that, even introducing a system - Memoriam - specifically dedicated to it.<br /> <br /> The 1-power-per-dot thing strikes me as overly restrictive for elder characters, especially as there's no limit on the number of amalgam powers you can buy. In some cases it denies you abilities that you had before - you can no longer have earth meld, wolf form, bat form <i>and </i>mist form, for instance, one of them has to go. But you do have greater versatility in Discipline development to compensate.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> wait does an amalgam take a dot-spot or not? For instance requires Oblivion X Potence y, does that occupy an Oblivion spot?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 07-08-2020, 01:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T10:54:43-07:00","id":1401714,"title":"","content":"I think we're getting pretty far from Justin here...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JezMiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1401700#post1401700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But you do have greater versatility in Discipline development to compensate.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't really think that's going to satisfy people that want a greater distinction between neonates, elders, and methuselahs.<br /> <br /> While I don't have a problem with V5 deciding to cap Disciplines at 5, the cap on powers-per-dot, and the condensing of multiple early Disciplines into single Disciplines in V5 undo a lot of the versatility the core setup could have accomplished. &quot;This vampire is better at being fast, while this vampire is better at balancing,&quot; isn't really a strong point of versatility in development compared to what previous editions or VtR can do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T11:05:32-07:00","id":1401717,"title":"","content":"Yes, if people want to discuss Advanced Disciplines they should create a new thread.<br /> <br /> Or I will:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__