let's think!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6363-pm\u00e1rk","name":"PM\u00e1rk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2363"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T12:45:11-07:00","id":1401736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PM\u00e1rk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1401733#post1401733\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because it's a totally different setting, on many levels. Simple as that. Everyone could have their own preferences of which they like better, but it's undeniably not the same setting.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">If you're referring to V5 then please leave the thread and consider yourself under warning for Edition Warring. We do not tolerate that anymore.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-09T19:04:41-07:00","id":1402004,"title":"","content":"Main thing about Justin Achilli, who is mostly associated with Vampire in it\u2019s incarnations after (and including Vampire Revised, is that he isn\u2019t afraid to ignore the rantings of fans of all stripes, and just do things his own way. He is an experienced hand but the memories from the 1990s, when he took over, was as somebody who didn\u2019t suffer fools and had a pretty sardonic wit for dismissing them with cutting remarks and gestures. I don\u2019t know how the WoD setting or rules will develop, but my take is that he\u2019s more pragmatic than ideological about such things.<br /> <br /> Main thing for me, though, is that Modiphius gets a bit of a move on with its publications. The Onyx Path has been doing well in getting support out for V5 (Cults of the Blood Gods is a really interesting entree for me, and Chicago is as good a campaign book as any for any game), but aside from the Fall of London campaign and a few intro supplements, we haven\u2019t had much from Modiphius recently. The Players Handbook, which is mainly a priority for some because they want to see the rest of the Clans is stalling, but the big supplement I wanted to see was The Second Inquisition book.<br /> <br /> So, I don\u2019t know what Justin\u2019s role is exactly, but if he can get things moving, get more books on the shelves in hobby shops and generally communicates a clear direction for the line as a whole, then it has to be good news.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2517,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","user":"Trippy","date":". 07-09-2020, 10:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-11T08:52:54-07:00","id":1402255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1402004#post1402004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-ar