s is a silly divergence and has nothing to do with Justin Achilli. Gargoyles are a Bloodline, Tremere are a Clan, and Salubri are an ex-Clan.</span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-11T15:00:30-07:00","id":1402305,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1402302#post1402302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is a silly divergence and has nothing to do with Justin Achilli. Gargoyles are a Bloodline, Tremere are a Clan, and Salubri are an ex-Clan.</span><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>And Gargoyles will not be in PG and the sky is blue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-11T15:51:28-07:00","id":1402312,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blailton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1402305#post1402305\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And Gargoyles will not be in PG and the sky is blue.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fact is that The Player\u2019s Guide for V5 hasn\u2019t been published yet, and we don\u2019t know what will be in it yet.<br /> <br /> The reason why the Clans are now meant to be detailed in it was because it was a suggestion by fans (including me, actually!) to include them when Modiphius solicited ideas and suggestions for the book on their forums a few years ago. While there has been snippets of news discussed online, it is not set in stone and it has been delayed. Unless you are a V5 writer or developer, how would anybody know whether Gargoyles or any other bloodline are going to be in it or not? The advantage of having a strong, experienced developer like Justin Achilli to guide the line is he may be able to speed up the process of books like the Players Guide being published - mainly because he will be decisive about what should or shouldn\u2019t be included. He gets to decide - you don\u2019t.<br /> <br /> Moreover, all this <i>is</i> a deflection and this is the second thread I\u2019ve noticed this week (the other being about Wraith 5) where you have thrown in a totally off topic sly dig at V5. Habit, perhaps?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2517,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","user":"Trippy","date":". 07-11-2020, 06:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-11T15:59:59-07:00","id":1402313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1402312#post1402312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fact is that The Player\u2019s Guide for V5 hasn\u2019t been published yet, and we don\u2019t know what will be in it yet.<br /> <br /> The reason why the Clans are now meant to be detailed in it was because it was a suggestion by fans (including me, actually!) to include them when Modiphius solicited ideas and suggestions for the book on their forums a few years ago. While there has been snippets of news discussed online, it is not set in stone and it has been delayed. Unless you are a V5 writer or developer, how would anybody know whether Gargoyles or any other bloodline are going to be in it or not? The advantage of having a strong, experienced developer like Justin Achilli to guide the line is he may be able to speed up the process of books like the Players Guide being published - mainly because he will be decisive about what should or shouldn\u2019t be included. He gets to decide - you don\u2019t.<br /> <br /> Moreover, all this <i>is</i> a deflection and this is the second thread I\u2019ve noticed this week (the other being about Wraith 5) where you have thrown in a totally off topic sly dig at V5. Habit, perhaps?</div> </div> </div> </div>ZzzzzzzzzzZzzzzzzzz","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-11T16:15:23-07:00","id":1402316,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blailton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1402313#post1402313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ZzzzzzzzzzZzzzzzzzz</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">The red text above was a polite warning. This is not. Please leave the thread.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-11-2020, 09:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T07:31:37-07:00","id":1407694,"title":"","content":"Justin is solid. I expect great thing. That being said, he was also one of the main writers of Revised and I'm genuinely concerned he might try to ween away from the V5 ruleset and try and push for revisions that are more in line to what he knows. But as long as he understands (and hopefully appreciates) the V5 changes and is ready to approve content that is aligned with these changes, everything should be fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2462-karlb","name":"KarlB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T10:03:31-07:00","id":1408182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KarlB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1407694#post1407694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Justin is solid. I expect great thing. That being said, he was also one of the main writers of Revised and I'm genuinely concerned he might try to ween away from the V5 ruleset and try and push for revisions that are more in line to what he knows. But as long as he understands (and hopefully appreciates) the V5 changes and is ready to approve content that is aligned with these changes, everything should be fine.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's my irrational fear, but it's not logical. Paradox will not allow heavy hewing away from the baselines (even as those baselines have been stretched by OPP's writing), considering literally everything they've licensed is based on V5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T07:51:20-07:00","id":1410061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Flag</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1400436#post1400436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> However, he never cared for paths of enlightenment, nor have any of the developers since 2e. The general consensus is that the Sabbat's function as the low-Humanity sect is undermined by giving them all these paths that give them an out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Back in the days of WW, I wanted to split the difference and get rid of Paths as an alternative to Humanity, and instead introduce them as philophies a Sabbat (or other) vampire could learn as an Ability to help them forestall losing those last 3 or 4 dots of Humanity they've got left (essentially letting them circle the drain just a little longer, at their low Humanity ratings, with these path teachings, using a rigid code of made-up rationalized ritualized psychobabble to cling to their sanity).<br /> <br /> So we'd get to keep 'Paths,' in a sense, but they wouldn't replace Humanity, so much as be a stop-gap to allow Sabbat to function at low, low Humanity scores for longer than expected.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23754-ian-turner","name":"Ian Turner","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-27T10:14:59-07:00","id":1410703,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ian Turner</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1410061#post1410061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Back in the days of WW, I wanted to split the difference and get rid of Paths as an alternative to Humanity, and instead introduce them as philophies a Sabbat (or other) vampire could learn as an Ability to help them forestall losing those last 3 or 4 dots of Humanity they've got left (essentially letting them circle the drain just a little longer, at their low Humanity ratings, with these path teachings, using a rigid code of made-up rationalized ritualized psychobabble to cling to their sanity).<br /> <br /> So we'd get to keep 'Paths,' in a sense, but they wouldn't replace Humanity, so much as be a stop-gap to allow Sabbat to function at low, low Humanity scores for longer than expected.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I loved them for being alternatives to Humanity, for allowing inhuman monsters to be exactly that: inhuman, not 'low humanity' or 'immoral' but having a completely different morality entirely, and really allowing us to get down into the weeds about alternate morality, the nature of evil, the power of intellect vs instinct, the nature of the Beast etc, in a way Humanity alone simply doesn't, and cannot. IMHO any vampire clinging to Humanity is a delusional time bomb primed to wassail, and that should be hammered home. Hard. (Plus alternate routes to Golconda was really interesting)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 08-27-2020, 01:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-27T11:05:14-07:00","id":1410713,"title":"","content":"the restrictive nature of humanity makes vampires seem more humane than humans, which is paradoxical,<br /> it also prevents certain character types for vampires<br /> <br /> you can make a human serial killer that just kills and then...well, carries on killing,<br /> you can make them an unfeeling psycopath or a pervert who takes pleasure from blood<br /> <br /> however, a vampire serial killer is forced to feel remorse and cry about their actions every time they succeed on the conscience roll,<br /> the alternative being degeneration and wassail<br /> <br /> you can't have that vampire be a total unremorseful cold killer,<br /> at least not with humanity,<br /> you need a path like path of power or path of death or something to make it possible","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-04T07:16:07-07:00","id":1411792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1410703#post1410703\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I loved them for being alternatives to Humanity, for allowing inhuman monsters to be exactly that: inhuman, not 'low humanity' or 'immoral' but having a completely different morality entirely, and really allowing us to get down into the weeds about alternate morality, the nature of evil, the power of intellect vs instinct, the nature of the Beast etc, in a way Humanity alone simply doesn't, and cannot. IMHO any vampire clinging to Humanity is a delusional time bomb primed to wassail, and that should be hammered home. Hard. (Plus alternate routes to Golconda was really interesting)</div> </div> </div> </div>This^<br /> <br /> A nonhuman species clinging to humanity is absurd, and that absurdity should be reflected mechanically. Far more logical to adopt beliefs that synergize with what they actually are.<br /> <br /> In my Sabbat game, I reflect this by having the Cammie NPCs all have very low humanity, because they are attempting something impossible, ignorant, and absurd. I really play up how physically degenerated their appearance is due to low humanity, making them look like severe addicts or late stage cancer victims. One of the methods that the players are using to convert Cammies is simply offering them a sane alternative to humanity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-04T18:40:32-07:00","id":1411970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1411792#post1411792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This^<br /> <br /> A nonhuman species clinging to humanity is absurd, and that absurdity should be reflected mechanically. Far more logical to adopt beliefs that synergize with what they actually are.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a nature vs. nurture conflict and the source of what I think is the strongest element of the setting.<br /> <br /> A vampire is naturally a predator and it is easy to give into that.<br /> <br /> However, a vampire is a person raised to be human.<br /> <br /> In simple terms, &quot;Yes, you can be true to your nature but then you are evil and deserve to be destroyed.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-04T19:16:02-07:00","id":1411976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1400247-justin-achilli-is-now-the-brand-creative-lead-for-the-world-of-darkness?p=1411792#post1411792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A nonhuman species clinging to humanity is absurd.</div> </div> </div> </div>Absurdity is a tenet of existentialism. As such, the nature of the conflict between a nonhuman entity clinging on to their humanity is what gives the game its personal horror motif. I think this is what people are getting at.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theony